    <main>
      <section class="policy-hero">
        <div class="wrap">
          <span class="eyebrow">Official Policy</span>
          <h1>10% Referral<br />Commission Policy</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            The complete rules governing Kumtech Gateway's permanent referral
            commission program.
          </p>
          <div class="policy-meta">
            <span class="pill">Version 1.0</span
            ><span class="pill">Effective 2 September 2026</span
            ><span class="pill">Permanent Referral Policy</span>
          </div>
          <div class="summary-box">
            <div class="summary-10">10<span>%</span></div>
            <p>
              <strong style="color: #fff">Policy summary:</strong> Anyone may
              refer a new client to Kumtech Gateway. When the referred client
              qualifies under this policy and successfully pays Kumtech for an
              eligible service, the referrer earns a commission equal to 10% of
              the qualifying Kumtech service fee.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section alt">
        <div class="wrap policy-layout">
          <aside class="toc">
            <h3>On this page</h3>
            <a href="#policy-1">1. Purpose</a
            ><a href="#policy-2">2. Who Can Refer</a
            ><a href="#policy-3">3. What Counts as a Valid Referral</a
            ><a href="#policy-4">4. Commission Rate and Calculation</a
            ><a href="#policy-5">5. Amounts Excluded from Commission</a
            ><a href="#policy-6">6. When Commission Is Earned and Paid</a
            ><a href="#policy-7">7. Referral Identification and Records</a
            ><a href="#policy-8"
              >8. Client Relationship and Project Acceptance</a
            ><a href="#policy-9">9. Integrity and Misuse</a
            ><a href="#policy-10">10. Policy Changes</a
            ><a href="#examples">Illustrative examples</a
            ><a href="/referral">← Back to Referral Program</a>
          </aside>
          <div class="policy-content">
            <article id="policy-1" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">01</div>
              <div>
                <h2>1. Purpose</h2>
                <p>
                  This policy establishes Kumtech Gateway’s permanent referral
                  commission programme. Its purpose is to reward people who
                  introduce genuine new clients while keeping referral payments
                  transparent, sustainable, and tied to revenue actually
                  received by Kumtech.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-2" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">02</div>
              <div>
                <h2>2. Who Can Refer</h2>
                <p>
                  The referral programme is open to clients, former clients,
                  partners, friends, community members, promoters, and other
                  members of the public.
                </p>
                <p>
                  A person may not claim commission for referring themselves or
                  for a project in which they are the paying client or direct
                  project owner.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Kumtech may refuse referrals that appear fraudulent,
                  misleading, abusive, or otherwise unsuitable.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-3" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">03</div>
              <div>
                <h2>3. What Counts as a Valid Referral</h2>
                <p>
                  The referred client must be new to Kumtech Gateway and must
                  not already be in active discussion, negotiation, quotation,
                  onboarding, or an existing client relationship with Kumtech.
                </p>
                <p>
                  The referrer must be identified when the lead first contacts
                  Kumtech, or before Kumtech begins active sales discussions
                  with that lead.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Referral claims cannot normally be added retroactively after a
                  client is already in Kumtech’s pipeline.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-4" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">04</div>
              <div>
                <h2>4. Commission Rate and Calculation</h2>
                <p>
                  Commission rate: 10% of the qualifying Kumtech service fee
                  actually paid by the referred client.
                </p>
                <p>
                  If Kumtech gives the client a discount, the commission is
                  calculated on the final discounted service fee actually paid.
                </p>
                <p>
                  For one-off projects, the 10% applies to the eligible project
                  service fee received by Kumtech.
                </p>
                <p>
                  For recurring services, including Social Media Management, the
                  10% applies to the first paid month only unless a separate
                  written referral arrangement states otherwise.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-5" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">05</div>
              <div>
                <h2>5. Amounts Excluded from Commission</h2>
                <p>
                  Referral commission is calculated only on Kumtech’s eligible
                  service fee. Unless expressly included in writing, the
                  following are excluded:
                </p>
                <p>
                  Domain names, hosting, cloud infrastructure, software
                  subscriptions, licences, plugins, and other third-party
                  technology costs.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Printing, production, delivery, advertising spend, media
                  budgets, photography or talent fees paid to third parties, and
                  other pass-through expenses.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Taxes, statutory charges, refunds, credits, reimbursements,
                  and amounts Kumtech collects solely on behalf of another
                  provider.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-6" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">06</div>
              <div>
                <h2>6. When Commission Is Earned and Paid</h2>
                <p>
                  Commission is earned only after Kumtech has successfully
                  received the qualifying client payment.
                </p>
                <p>
                  No commission is payable on unpaid, cancelled, refunded,
                  fraudulent, reversed, or disputed amounts.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Where a project is paid in instalments, Kumtech may calculate
                  and release the referral commission after the qualifying
                  project payment has been fully received, unless Kumtech
                  confirms another arrangement in writing.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Once eligibility is confirmed and the qualifying payment has
                  cleared, Kumtech will normally process the referral payment
                  within 7 business days.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-7" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">07</div>
              <div>
                <h2>7. Referral Identification and Records</h2>
                <p>
                  The referrer should provide enough information for Kumtech to
                  match the referral to the correct client, such as the client’s
                  name, business name, phone number, or email address.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Kumtech’s internal client and referral records will be used to
                  determine whether a referral was received first and whether
                  the client was already in the sales pipeline.
                </p>
                <p>
                  If two people claim the same referral, Kumtech will review the
                  available records and recognise the person whose qualifying
                  referral can be reasonably verified first.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-8" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">08</div>
              <div>
                <h2>8. Client Relationship and Project Acceptance</h2>
                <p>
                  A referral does not guarantee that Kumtech will accept the
                  client or project.
                </p>
                <p>
                  All referred clients remain subject to Kumtech’s normal
                  discovery, scope, pricing, contract, payment, and
                  project-acceptance processes.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Referrers are not authorised to promise prices, discounts,
                  timelines, deliverables, or contractual terms on behalf of
                  Kumtech unless Kumtech has expressly authorised them to do so.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-9" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">09</div>
              <div>
                <h2>9. Integrity and Misuse</h2>
                <p>
                  Referrers must represent Kumtech truthfully and must not use
                  misleading claims, spam, impersonation, fake leads, or
                  pressure tactics.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Kumtech may withhold or cancel a commission where there is
                  reasonable evidence of fraud, manipulation, duplicate claims,
                  misrepresentation, or abuse of the programme.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="policy-10" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">10</div>
              <div>
                <h2>10. Policy Changes</h2>
                <p>
                  This is a permanent Kumtech Gateway policy, but Kumtech may
                  revise its administrative rules when necessary to protect the
                  programme, comply with applicable requirements, or improve
                  operations. Any material change to the 10% commission
                  structure will apply prospectively and should be documented in
                  a new policy version.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article id="examples" class="policy-card">
              <div class="policy-num">%</div>
              <div>
                <h2>Illustrative Examples</h2>
                <p>
                  These examples show the approved 10% calculation on qualifying
                  service fees paid.
                </p>
                <table class="example-table">
                  <thead>
                    <tr>
                      <th>Qualifying service fee paid</th>
                      <th>Commission rate</th>
                      <th>Referral commission</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>75,000 XAF</td>
                      <td>10%</td>
                      <td><strong>7,500 XAF</strong></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>150,000 XAF</td>
                      <td>10%</td>
                      <td><strong>15,000 XAF</strong></td>
